        "content": "<p>Huh! So it does!<br>\nAnd, ah, yeah, that sounds like it could be the reason for the fix (though I wouldn't know).<br>\nThanks! I guess I just need to update my local copy of mathlib then. Though, I thought I tried it on that webpage earlier today and it failed there, but it's not failing now, so...<br>\nWell, if it works, I suppose I don't need to worry about it. Thanks!</p>",
