    {
        "content": "<p>The context is that 2 months ago there were some disruptive changes to how lean works. In particular, many instances did not work anymore, and we're still in the process of fixing everying. <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/37970\">#37970</a> was merged very recently, so I woudn't be surprised if the example failed for you earlier in the day.</p>\n<p>And the option <code>set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false in</code> can be used to get back the old behaviour, which is sometimes necessary when instances are still broken.</p>",
        "id": 585360374,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1776155170
    }
